## Motivation

Reduce vision rotary overhead in DeepSeek-V4.1 multimodal inference. The eager path constructs float32 intermediates and separate pointwise/concatenation outputs for Q and K. A four-image request invokes this operation 128 times per replica in the measured workload.

Related: #44451 addresses the same operation. This PR offers a different implementation: one joint Q/K Triton launch, out-of-place outputs, and FP32 arithmetic with FP contraction disabled, versus separate in-place CUDA C++ launches with fast math. The comparison below is intended to help evaluate the alternatives;

